---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Moving from Ghana to the UK: The Complete Guide | AfriMigrate"
  description="A complete, free guide to moving from Ghana to the UK — the Skilled Worker visa, costs, sponsorship, and the path to settlement."
>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/blog">Blog</a> / Ghana to UK</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">Guide · Ghana → UK</div>
  <h1>Moving from Ghana to the UK: The Complete Guide</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
    Ghanaian nurses, care workers, engineers and IT professionals have driven one of the fastest-growing migration corridors into the UK in recent years. Here's the realistic path.
  </p>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Step 1</div>
    <h2>Find a licensed sponsor</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px;">
      Unlike Canada or Australia, the UK's main route requires a confirmed job offer from a Home Office-licensed sponsor before you can apply. NHS trusts, care providers and IT companies are among the most active sponsors of Ghanaian talent.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Step 2</div>
    <h2>Check you meet the core requirements</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px;">
      Salary threshold, occupation skill level, and English ability (CEFR B1) are the three pillars. Use our free checker to see where you stand before committing to anything.
    </p>
    <a href="/uk/skilled-worker-visa-checker" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Check my eligibility →</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Step 3</div>
    <h2>Budget for the Immigration Health Surcharge</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px;">
      The IHS is often the single biggest surprise cost for Ghanaian applicants — it's charged per year of your visa, per person, on top of the application fee. Calculate your full family's cost before you commit.
    </p>
    <a href="/uk/visa-cost-calculator" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Calculate visa costs →</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Step 4</div>
    <h2>Plan for the long game</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px;">
      Most Skilled Worker visa holders reach Indefinite Leave to Remain after five continuous years. Understand the milestones and common pitfalls before you land.
    </p>
    <a href="/uk/ilr-roadmap" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">See the ILR roadmap →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
